; fas9_surfaces_iso2.scr - facit script of step 9.16, third round (F9.18, Opus): the isolines of surfaces AutoCAD keeps as a
;   procedure (an offset, a network) and of a curved loft of four sections. Run it with
;   python -I tools/fas9_facit_run.py doc/facit/fas9_surfaces_iso2.scr
; One drawing, saved once (surfaces_iso2):
;   G  a curved loft of three splines converted to NURBS, then that NURBS offset by 3 (SURFOFFSET)
;   H  a network surface of two splines along x and two lines along y (SURFNETWORK)
;   I  a curved loft of four equal splines, evenly spaced (z 0, 10, 20, 30, y 0, 6, 6, 0)
